# sgo.build (schema: see core/sgo.build). wata-tui is an APP over core + json +
# wataclient (the portable client core) with no device layer: a line-oriented
# command REPL on the host, the second client and the admin surface.
mode app
emitname wata-tui
binname wata-tui
gomod watatui
optreport
# The embedded iroh transport (plan 0013): the same plain Go dep wata-fb rides,
# so WATA_IROH_CONFIG makes the tui an iroh client too. Its REAL cgo build is
# opt-in (darwin + `-tags iroh`); ordinary builds ride the pure-Go stub.
godep github.com/adriaanm/wata/go-pkgs/irohnet go-pkgs/irohnet
